  "online_dependencies": [
    "The private image caches the selected DOG, OpenTelemetry demo, Litefuse and alert-load container digests. No running services, telemetry, users or completed Labs are baked into the image.",
    "The first build requires Ubuntu/Docker APT, PyPI, Docker Hub, GHCR and Quay. First course setup fetches ai-observe/ai-observe-stack at the commit pinned by the selected course source; Grafana plugin setup may contact its publisher.",
    "When obs-local-model is selected, the llama.cpp container is cached. The optional Lab downloads Qwen2.5 0.5B Instruct from its pinned Hugging Face revision into a disposable course volume and checks the source-declared SHA256 before use. The model weights are not baked into the AMI.",
    "obs-openai is not certified by this image path. External model credentials and spending limits need a separate explicit selection. Main-path Litefuse examples use synthetic model outputs and make no external model calls.",
    "Browser checkpoints coordinate documented flag, dashboard and alert setup; they do not establish GUI acceptance. Independent real-browser evidence on the audited instance is required before publication."
  ]
